r",["VAR_UNK_412D","1"]],["NPCMsg",["msg_0364_R25R0101_00016"]],["GoTo",["_0490"]],["CallStd",["std_bag_is_full"]],["CloseMsg",[]],["ReleaseAll",[]],["End",[]],["NPCMsg",["msg_0364_R25R0101_00017"]],["GoTo",["_0490"]],["NPCMsg",["msg_0364_R25R0101_00013"]],["WaitButton",[]],["CloseMsg",[]],["ReleaseAll",[]],["End",[]]]},"messages":{"msg_0364_R25R0101_00000":"Hmm? You are here for my grandson?\\nHis name is Bill.\\rHe’s in Johto.\\nHe does something with PCs,\\fso I’m house-sitting.\\r","msg_0364_R25R0101_00001":"Ah, my grandson mentioned a round,\\nblue Pokémon that has leaves\\fgrowing on its head.\\r","msg_0364_R25R0101_00002":"Bill told me about a Pokémon that is\\nvery loyal to its Trainer.\\fIt’s a Fire-type Pokémon that’s\\fsupposed to Roar well.\\r","msg_0364_R25R0101_00003":"Do you know that Pokémon with large,\\nround eyes.\\rThe one that sings a lullaby with\\nits cute voice!\\r","msg_0364_R25R0101_00004":"Do you know that hugely popular\\nPokémon?\\rThe Pokémon that has a yellow body\\nand bright red cheeks...\\rI would love to see what it looks\\nlike before it evolves.\\r","msg_0364_R25R0101_00005":"I heard that there is a blue and round\\nPokémon in Johto.\\rBill told me that the end of its tail\\nworks like a float.\\rIts belly is white. Just the belly.\\nI would love to see what it looks like.\\r","msg_0364_R25R0101_00006":"My grandson Bill told me about a\\nPokémon that has a long tongue.\\rIt has ringlike marks on the front\\nof its legs, he said!\\r","msg_0364_R25R0101_00007":"Ah, my grandson mentioned a round,\\nblue Pokémon that has leaves\\fgrowing on its head.\\r","msg_0364_R25R0101_00008":"Do you know of a sea Pokémon that\\nhas a red sphere in its body?\\fYou know, the one that’s shaped like\\fa star?\\rI heard that it appears at night.\\nI would surely like to see it.\\r","msg_0364_R25R0101_00009":"I heard about a cute Pokémon that\\nhas six tails.\\rI would love to hug a cute Pokémon\\nlike that.\\r","msg_0364_R25R0101_00010":"Do you know that hugely popular\\nPokémon?\\rThe Pokémon that has a yellow body\\nand bright red cheeks...\\rI would love to see what it looks\\nlike before it evolves.\\r","msg_0364_R25R0101_00011":"If you have that Pokémon,\\nmay I see it, please? {YESNO 0}","msg_0364_R25R0101_00012":"You will show me?\\nHow good of you!\\r","msg_0364_R25R0101_00013":"You don’t have it?\\nThat’s too bad...","msg_0364_R25R0101_00014":"Hm?\\rThat’s not the Pokémon that I was\\ntold about...","msg_0364_R25R0101_00015":"Wow!\\nThat Pokémon is called {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}!\\rIt’s a wonderful Pokémon!\\nAs a token of my appreciation,\\fI would like to give this to you!\\r","msg_0364_R25R0101_00016":"Come visit again\\nsometime.","msg_0364_R25R0101_00017":"Thanks for showing me so many\\ncute Pokémon.\\fI really enjoyed myself.\\rI’m glad I’ve lived such a long life.","msg_0364_R25R0101_00018":"There is a dusty machine under\\nthe cloth cover...\\fIt has not been used for some time."},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_R25R0101_000":0,"obj_R25R0101_gsoldman1":0}}
